  "question": {
    "text": "The geometric mean of <math> <mn>6</mn> </math> observations was calculated as <math> <mrow> <mn>13.</mn></mrow> </math> It was later observed that one of the observations was recorded as <math> <mrow> <mn>28</mn></mrow> </math> instead of <math> <mrow> <mn>36.</mn></mrow> </math> The correct geometric mean is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></msup></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>3</mn><mi> </mi><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></msup></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>13</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></msup></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math> <mrow> <mn>13</mn><msup> <mrow> <mfenced> <mrow> <mfrac> <mn>7</mn> <mn>9</mn> </mfrac> </mrow> </mfenced></mrow> <mrow> <mfrac> <mn>1</mn> <mn>6</mn> </mfrac> </mrow> </msup> </mrow> </math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "Let <math><msub><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><msub><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>…</mo><mo>,</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><msub><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msub></math> are the observations and <math><msub><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>28</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mn>28</mn><mo>.</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><msub><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>…</mo><msub><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>13</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><msub><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>…</mo><msub><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>13</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>28</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br />Now correct observation is <math> <mrow> <mn>36</mn></mrow> </math> &nbsp;<br /><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mn>36</mn><mo>.</mo><msub><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>…</mo><msub><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>13</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>28</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>36</mn></math><br /><br />So, now correct geometric mean <math><mo>=</mo><mn>13</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></msup></math>"
  }
